cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol or the archived results, cite the repository and the paper."
title: "Forecast 2040: a time-stamped panel protocol with a machine-checked split for long-horizon car demand"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and results for a pre-registered rolling-origin forecast comparison of
  thirteen models on a panel of seventeen European car markets, with two-way clustered
  inference, split conformal intervals, a projection to 2040, and the information split
  and the selection rule checked in Lean 4.
type: software
